<p>
  The table below shows the hardware speedup on NVIDIA Blackwell Tensor Cores. On GB300, NVFP4 delivers
  <strong>6× the arithmetic throughput</strong> of BF16 — the same as MXFP4, but with meaningfully better convergence.
</p>

<table class="fmt-table">
  <thead>
