<div class="callout callout-purple">
  <span class="callout-icon">🔬</span>
  <p><strong>Key takeaway:</strong> MXFP4 requires training on 36% more tokens to match the validation loss
  of NVFP4 trained on 1T tokens. On GB300 hardware where both formats run at 6× BF16 throughput, this means
  NVFP4 effectively offers 36% more efficient utilisation of compute at equivalent accuracy. Future work
  includes quantizing attention layers and extending to mixture-of-experts architectures.</p>
</div>
